	(text "LP5522 LED driver\n* Constant current source\n* Current can be set with external resistor (RISET)\n* Current ratio between resistor and LED is 1:400. RISET current correlates to ISET reference voltage (VISET).\n* VISET = 1.23 V (Typ)\n* With single resistor, current through LED can be adjusted using equation IOUT = 480/RISET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
